+	  Raises the DDR3 clock of an RK3128 from the loader's rate (300 MHz)
+	  to at most 400 MHz (the Rockchip kernel's 396 MHz) with the Rockchip
+	  kernel's self-refresh, DPLL and controller sequence, run from the
+	  internal SRAM: at probe to the node's rockchip,boot-mhz (or
+	  rk3128_dmc.boot_mhz; 0 leaves the loader's rate), and on a write
